      <title>Android 滚动截屏按钮灰掉：不是 Bug，而是实现机制的必然结果</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/Android-%E6%BB%9A%E5%8A%A8%E6%88%AA%E5%B1%8F%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E7%81%B0%E6%8E%89%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF-Bug%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C/</link>
